        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <ns4:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of an organismal system over time, from its formation to the mature structure. A system is a regularly interacting or interdependent group of organs or tissues that work together to carry out a given biological process.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
